Model2GDS Design Explorer — project and upstream attribution

This portable package contains rendered images of selected top-level geometry
from the independently qualified historical 2x2 and 4x4 FINAL_002 GDS designs.
It does not distribute complete GDS files, SPEF files, or a PDK installation.
The rendering omits referenced standard-cell internals, cuts and labels; the
precise display policy and original GDS hashes are in assets/layout_manifest.json.
The routed designs were implemented using SKY130 and the libraries below.

